{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5PS2V7pBFRfA8BtzVk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain is dark oak, centuries old, scarred by hands and weather and time. Iron studs dot my face in patterns that almost form words if you stare too long. My keyhole is a void — an eye that watches both directions at once.\n\nCold radiates from my surface. Frost traces the edges of my frame despite the season.\n\nNo handle exists on this side.\n\n**I am locked.**\n\nWhat stands before me?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":130,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}